# Hello, agy!
#
# A minimal single-member teamfile, fetched and seeded by `lmctl hello agy`.
# It's a connectivity check -- "is Antigravity (agy) reachable in my
# environment at all?" -- not a team you're meant to keep. Once it answers,
# either keep talking to it (`lmctl prompt agy.lmctl Lead "..."`) or delete
# the file.
#
# Want a real teamfile instead of a one-off check? See
# https://lmctl.com/lmctl/docs/manuals/teamfile-format

_MEMBER_ alias=Lead provider=agy
